<title>USA: Prentiss Properties buys Midwest properties.</title>
<headline>Prentiss Properties buys Midwest properties.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prentiss Properties Trust, an office and industrial real estate investment trust, said it acquired properties in Chicago and Detroit totaling 700,488 square feet for about $35 million.</p>
<p>Acquisitions included a 455,858-square-foot distribution facility in Chicago and two office buildings totaling 244,630 square feet in suburban Detroit.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
